---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About - Yonatan N. Degefu" description="What motivates Yonatan N. Degefu, how he approaches research problems, and his interests beyond the lab.">
  <div class="about-container">
    <p class="eyebrow page-kicker">What motivates me</p>
    <h1>About Me</h1>

    <section class="bio-section">
      <div class="bio-content">
        <p>
          I am interested in how living systems make decisions, and in using that understanding to
          improve treatment. In my work on melanoma, that means asking how cells interpret outside
          signals and take on different states. My earlier work on tuberculosis began with a different
          challenge: finding better drug combinations in the face of resistance.
        </p>
        <p>
          My background spans biology, mathematics, and chemistry. I bring those perspectives together
          through experimental data, computational analysis, and mathematical models.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bio-section" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
      <h2 id="approach-heading">How I approach problems</h2>
      <p>
        The question determines which tools I use. To understand cell behavior, I translate proposed
        mechanisms into models, compare their predictions with data, and work with experimental
        collaborators to investigate where the two disagree. To explore drug combinations, I combine
        efficient measurements with automated analysis and machine learning. Across these projects,
        I aim to turn complex observations into explanations and predictions we can test.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="bio-section" aria-labelledby="beyond-heading">
      <h2 id="beyond-heading">Beyond research</h2>
      <p>
        I enjoy spending time outdoors and cooking, and I speak English and Amharic. I also care about
        mentoring, community service, and making science accessible beyond the lab.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
